    "name": "Car API Documentation OBD Codes API",
    "description": "Welcome to CarAPIs vehicle API documentation. The developer friendly Car API.\nStart developing with your vehicle API today \u2014 no fees, no signup. CarAPIs free vehicle data-set\nrequires no account. Only pay when you're ready to go live. The free data-set is limited to 2015-2020 vehicles.\nTo access the full data-set you may signup here and then select a subscription plan.\n\n**Additional Documentation**\n\nFor additional documentation please review https://carapi.app/docs.\n\n**SDKs**\n\nPHP SDK: https://github.com/car-api-team/carapi-php-sdk\n\n**Release Updates**\n\nCheck release history here: https://github.com/car-api-team/docs/releases",
