                "description": "Perform wildcard searches by code or description. For non-subscribers the results are limited to one code per category.\n\nThere are four different types of OBD-II codes (P, B, C, and U):\n\n- P: Power train (engine and transmission) systems\n- B: Body\n- C: Chassis\n- U: Network and wiring systems."
